Again, what does "better" mean?

In my opinion, Excalibur is better since when maximally enchanted it
does a sufficient amount of damage and is "easily" acquired for any
lawful character, which means that one can start using those enchant
weapon scrolls earlier and stop worrying about weapons.  I also like
the level drain prevention for an early character or while dancing
with foocubi.  Overall, though there isn't much difference in
cuisinart ability between a Valk dual-wielding Excalibur and a silver
saber versus Grayswandir and a silver saber; both are formidable.

Of course Grayswandir does more damage and also does silver damage, so
is great to have.  Trouble is you need to potentially spend a while
sacrificing to get it, but if it falls on your lap, I'd recommend
Grayswandir.

